%% Unified order flow sequence (COD + Online) with webhook and realtime via socket
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client (Web/App)
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant O as Order Service
  participant P as Product Service
  participant Pay as Payment Service
  participant U as User Service
  participant Ext as External Gateway (Stripe/MoMo)
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant S as Socket Gateway

  Note over C: Place order (cart, address, paymentMethod)

  C->>G: POST /customer/orders {cart,addressId|address,paymentMethod}\nAuthorization: Bearer ...
  G->>O: Forward request (+x-user-id,role, Authorization)
  O->>U: Verify auth / get user profile
  U-->>O: user {id, role, scopes}
  opt addressId provided
    O->>U: Get address by id
    U-->>O: Address details
  end
  O->>P: Quote pricing (items, restaurant, delivery)
  P-->>O: Quote {items, totals, taxes, discounts}

  alt paymentMethod == "cod"
    O->>O: Create order(status=confirmed, payment_status=unpaid)
    O->>MQ: Publish socket_events: OrderUpdated{orderId,status=confirmed}
    MQ-->>S: Consume socket_events
    S-->>C: websocket order:updated {status=confirmed}
    G-->>C: 201 {orderId,status=confirmed,payment_status=unpaid}
  else paymentMethod == "online"
    O->>O: Create order(status=pending, payment_status=pending)
    O->>MQ: Publish ORDER_EVENTS_QUEUE: PaymentPending{orderId,amount,currency,method,customerId}
    MQ-->>Pay: Consume PaymentPending
    Pay->>Ext: Create PaymentIntent/Session
    Ext-->>Pay: PaymentIntent created
    Pay-->>G: 201 {client_secret | checkout_url}
    G-->>C: 201 {client_secret | checkout_url}

    Note over Ext,Pay: User completes payment → webhook to payment-service

    Ext-->>Pay: Webhook (success/failure) + signature
    alt Payment succeeded
      Pay->>Pay: Mark payment=paid
      Pay->>MQ: Publish PAYMENT_EVENTS_QUEUE: PaymentSucceeded{orderId,txId,amount}
      MQ-->>O: Consume PaymentSucceeded
      O->>O: Update order(status=confirmed, payment_status=paid)
      O->>MQ: Publish socket_events: OrderUpdated{orderId,status=confirmed}
      MQ-->>S: Consume socket_events
      S-->>C: websocket order:updated {status=confirmed}
    else Payment failed
      Pay->>Pay: Mark payment=failed
      Pay->>MQ: Publish PAYMENT_EVENTS_QUEUE: PaymentFailed{orderId,reason}
      MQ-->>O: Consume PaymentFailed
      O->>O: Update order(payment_status=failed[, status=cancelled?])
      O->>MQ: Publish socket_events: OrderUpdated{orderId,payment_status=failed}
      MQ-->>S: Consume socket_events
      S-->>C: websocket order:updated {payment_status=failed}
    end
  end

  Note over MQ: Queues\n- ORDER_EVENTS_QUEUE: O → Pay\n- PAYMENT_EVENTS_QUEUE: Pay → O\n- socket_events: O/Pay/User → S → Client
